      "value": "Having sliders/blendshape for just the wrist portion shape should help this I can understand CASIO not wanting the watch to be deformed by scaling. \n\nColors being set to only very specific ones also make sense for a branded item like this. Would be nice to have a bundle with all colors at a discount though.\n\nI think the displaying other users time is a great feature request!",
